# Style props

Style props is a way to use CSS-in-JS styling technique to pass styles as props to style components without having to use a separate CSS file.

Flat style props, `sx`, and `__sx` accept named [responsive values](../responsive-values), using `_` for an unconditional base. Use explicit media query keys for ranges or other conditions. Property-level responsive arrays are not supported, but arrays can still compose whole style objects.

